# Recurring Tasks

This directory holds the instruction markdown files for every scheduled {{PERSONA_NAME}} job. Each file is read by an isolated Claude Code headless session (launched via `scripts/trigger-*-claude-code.sh` + a launchd plist) and tells that session what to do, where to write output, and how to deliver it. Edit the markdown to change behavior — no need to update the cron job.

